# Godot writes its *.import files with LF line endings whenever it imports a
# project. On this PC git would give them CRLF in an export (git archive follows
# core.autocrlf), so the first import of an export would change icon.svg.import,
# and an export that has changed no longer matches its stamp (SP\vc_lib.ps1,
# Resolve-VcProject) and is refused by run_batch. Keeping them LF makes an import
# change nothing.
*.import text eol=lf
